                &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ctx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;resp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;StatusCode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;200&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;resp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;StatusCode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;300&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Errorf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"discovery returned %s: %s"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;resp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="no"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Errorf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"discovery remained rate limited"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;This article deliberately does not reproduce a metric payload or query filters: discovery is the authoritative contract, and the query parameters are currently undeclared there. Copying guessed fields into production would create an integration that looks complete in review and fails its first acceptance test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That limitation affects architecture. If tenant, stage, and time-window filtering are mandatory acceptance tests, validate them against the live contract before committing the dashboard design; uncertainty here is resolved by the declared schema, not by optimistic client code.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  The decision rule
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Choose CloudWatch when AWS integration and managed alarms outweigh portability. Choose Grafana Cloud when the team needs a managed, multi-signal investigation surface and will govern its telemetry pipeline. Choose PostHog when checkout questions are dominated by funnel behavior. Choose Prometheus when control is worth explicit storage and on-call ownership.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Choose the lean metrics API when the dashboard has a bounded set of app-defined signals, the team is prepared to retain correlated failure evidence elsewhere, and polling-based alert evaluation is acceptable. Infrai is credible in that envelope because discovery makes the wire contract inspectable and its shared platform conventions reduce integration sprawl. It is a poor fit when the acceptance criteria include native incident routing, heartbeat detection, searchable span trees, source-map decoding, replay, or a documented multi-tenant filter model.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The final test is reconstruction time, not chart count.&lt;/strong&gt; Take one failed checkout, one duplicate worker delivery, and one job that never started; then prove which system answers each case and who gets paged. If the design cannot do that on paper, another dashboard panel will not rescue it.&lt;/p&gt;

