&lt;p&gt;What I Built&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Every tax season, freelancers, solo contractors, and digital creators face the exact same nightmare: Receipt Fatigue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Over the course of a year, you accumulate hundreds of SaaS invoices, hardware receipts, client lunch tabs, Uber rides, and coworking bills scattered across Gmail, Apple Wallet, bank statements, and downloads folders. Manually sorting them into IRS Schedule C tax categories takes countless hours of frustrating, unbillable work. Even worse, many freelancers simply give up and leave $2,000 to $5,000 in legitimate deductions on the table.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Existing solutions like Expensify or QuickBooks have two fatal flaws:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Privacy Trap: As a freelance software engineer or designer, your client invoices often contain confidential project names, proprietary hourly rates, client addresses, and banking account snippets protected by strict non-disclosure agreements (NDAs). Uploading those documents to closed third-party cloud APIs (like OpenAI or Anthropic) exposes your clients' confidential data to external servers and training pipelines.&lt;br&gt;
Subscription Fatigue: Solo builders don't want to pay $30/month for bloated accounting software that doesn't understand freelance tax rules.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built ReceiptDesk AI, deployed live in production at &lt;a href="https://shivysidinfo.tech" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://shivysidinfo.tech&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
: a 100% privacy-first, on-device invoice and receipt auditor designed specifically for freelancers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ReceiptDesk AI automatically:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ingests PDF invoices, scanned receipts, CSVs, or raw text.&lt;br&gt;
Extracts merchant, date, currency, line items, and totals using Google's open-weight Gemma 2 model.&lt;br&gt;
Automatically maps expenses to official IRS Schedule C tax deduction lines (Software &amp;amp; SaaS, De Minimis Equipment under $2,500, Coworking, Travel, and 50% Meals limitation).&lt;br&gt;
Indexes expense embeddings using Tiger Data pgvector for semantic similarity search ("Has this vendor been deducted before?", "Which category did my previous cloud hosting bill go to?").&lt;br&gt;
Evaluates your IRS Audit Health Score, flags duplicate billings, and exports TurboTax-ready Schedule C CSV spreadsheets in one click.&lt;br&gt;
